<h2 id="plan-your-visit">Plan Your Visit</h2>
<p>Plan to arrive a few minutes early to find a seat and expect to be greeted by smiling, friendly faces. All are welcome here at The Table and we hope you feel comfortable joining us.</p>
<h2 id="maps-and-parking">Maps and Parking</h2>
<p>Parking is available directly in front of the church building and we are located at:</p>
<p>1520 Blackburn Rd.<br>
Sachse, TX 75048</p>
<p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/First+United+Methodist+Church+of+Sachse/@32.9811548,-96.6117338,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x864c1c9046284965:0x1856018e2d9d4980!8m2!3d32.9811548!4d-96.6091589!16s%2Fg%2F1tgx6_qj?entry=ttu">Click here for a map and directions</a></p>
<h2 id="whats-next-the-table-class">What’s Next? The Table Class</h2>
<p>If you have been coming to The Table for a few weeks and have begun to ask the questions: “What’s next?”, “Where can I find out more?”, or “How do I join this community?”.</p>
<p>The answer to all of those questions can be found at our <strong><em>Welcome to the Table Class</em></strong>.</p>
<p>These classes are typically held on Sunday afternoons from 3:00pm-4:30pm and childcare will be available. Feel free to <a href="/contact-us/">send us a message</a> to find out when the next class will be offered.</p>
<h2 id="want-someone-to-contact-you">Want Someone to Contact You?</h2>
<p>If you would like someone to contact you, <a href="/contact-us/">please send us a message</a> and we will be in touch.</p>
</ContentPage>
